{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation capabilities, separating sensing from motion. The specification enforces safe exploration: always move forward when clear, rotate right to recover from any obstacle, and never enable forward motion when an obstacle is detected. Recovery states are one-shot and always return to forward progress as soon as the path is clear. Only rotate_clockwise is used for turning/recovery, ensuring deterministic, right-turning behavior.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for sensing and actuation to reflect real robot modularity.",
    "Specification automaton encodes the always-turn-right recovery, disables forward motion when unsafe, and ensures quick return to exploration after recovery."
  ],
